{"5161350": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hollow Flesh", "steam_appid": 5161350, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hollow Flesh is a first-person psychological horror game following a father searching a psychiatric hospital for his missing daughter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How long has it been? Did you leave her here?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why can't you remember?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find Her</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hospital opens one ward at a time. Search all of them. She has to be here. She has to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5161350/extras/f4a11db665b134fdbc43f295e5ee6f95.poster.avif?t=1787881347\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5161350/extras/f4a11db665b134fdbc43f295e5ee6f95.webm?t=1787881347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5161350/extras/f4a11db665b134fdbc43f295e5ee6f95.mp4?t=1787881347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Building Is Awake</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything is wrong now. Either this hospital is alive, or you are not well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5161350/extras/25fa6328bf4ca06d0cbc61b56e59dfd8.poster.avif?t=1787881347\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5161350/extras/25fa6328bf4ca06d0cbc61b56e59dfd8.webm?t=1787881347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5161350/extras/25fa6328bf4ca06d0cbc61b56e59dfd8.mp4?t=1787881347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >It Can Hear You</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move quietly. When it sees you, run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5161350/extras/a4e72d59495fb6d7f1f1c1c82be48b5c.poster.avif?t=1787881347\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5161350/extras/a4e72d59495fb6d7f1f1c1c82be48b5c.webm?t=1787881347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5161350/extras/a4e72d59495fb6d7f1f1c1c82be48b5c.mp4?t=1787881347\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Truth Is In Here</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nobody is going to explain this to you. You collect the pieces, you decide what they mean.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hollow Flesh is a first-person psychological horror game following a father searching a psychiatric hospital for his missing daughter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How long has it been? Did you leave her here?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why can't you remember?</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find Her</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hospital opens one ward at a time. Search all of them. She has to be here. She has to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5161350/extras/f4a11db665b134fdbc43f295e5ee6f95.poster.avif?t=1787881347\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5161350/extras/f4a11db665b134fdbc43f295e5ee6f95.webm?t=1787881347\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.